theme_type_variation = &"BodyText"
text = "A low violet scorpid that hunts by waiting. Its forked tail arches over its back and holds two cyan lures before its face, dead still, until prey comes within reach of its mantis striking arms. Keeping the lures costs it reserve. At the edge of another hunter's kill, it takes what it can."
